  "name": "WUFF",
  "shortName": null,
  "description": "WUFF, previously UA Furence, UAfurmeet and UkrFurence, was the main furry convention in Ukraine, held each year in a different place and time. The first was a New Year gathering in Lviv from December 30, 2005, to January 2, 2006, with 11 attendees, and from 2008 it was held each May in Kyiv. It was renamed WUFF in 2012 and led by Basil Lion, with attendance growing from 62 in 2008 to a peak of 260 in 2014. The last edition was held May 8 to 12, 2018.",
